---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Learn more about Locch and their journey"
	pubDate={new Date('January 24 2026')}
>
	<h2>Hi, there!</h2>
	
	<p>
		Welcome to my corner of the internet! I'm a developer who loves building things
		and sharing what I learn — through this blog and through open source.
	</p>

	<h3>What I'm Passionate About</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>Machine learning and software engineering</li>
		<li>Building performant, user-friendly applications</li>
		<li>Exploring new technologies and programming paradigms</li>
		<li>Writing clean, maintainable code</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		When I'm not coding, you can find me reading tech blogs, experimenting with side
		projects, or enjoying a good cup of coffee.
	</p>

	<h3>Let's Connect!</h3>
	<p>
		Feel free to reach out if you'd like to collaborate on a project, discuss ideas,
		or just say hello. Thanks for reading — happy coding!
	</p>
</Layout>
